<title>FINLAND: KESKO SEES FIM 83 MLN GAIN ON MTV SHR SALE.</title>
<headline>KESKO SEES FIM 83 MLN GAIN ON MTV SHR SALE.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish wholesaler and retailer Kesko Oy has sold all its 4,120 shares in Finnish commercial television company MTV Oy and would book an almost 83 million markka profit, it said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>Kesko did not identify the buyer.</p>
</text>
